# L §5.14.3 How a settlement leg counts (round 16, settling round 14's U-44): "For a change of places, the leg's places
# are both those it had before V and those V gives it, so a settlement leg between two of its `to` places ... counts 0
# ...: moving the booked amount to where V puts it (konto to konto2) settles a change of places alone, and a second
# payment into the new place counts in full, its amount owed back." L5_14_3_adjustment_place_change.test's model:
# move_acct moves wage[2026-03] from konto to konto2 (δ = 0); bank[r1] is a second payment of 5 000.00 PLN from world
# into konto2: it counts +5 000.00, so the remainder is 0 - 5 000.00 = -5 000.00 PLN, listed in the register of what
# reads konto2 (E §5 step 5; L §8.2 `adjustment:`), and konto2 holds the 5 000.00 PLN it booked (b). (Was
# REFCORE-UNSPECIFIED §5.14.3.)
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
source act "act"
source bank_export "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind wages: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place konto2: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input wage_amt: money PLN
input wage_dom: int
input pay_to: key accounts
input bank: observed
def net[m in months]: money PLN = wage_amt at start_of(m)
def dest[m in months]: key accounts = pay_to at start_of(m)

move wage[m in months]: wages
  on day_of(m, wage_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to dest[m] amount net[m]

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  wage_amt = 5 000.00 PLN "umowa"
  wage_dom = 10 "umowa"
  pay_to = konto "umowa"
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
  opening[konto2] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

version move_acct
  cite act
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-05-01
  replace pay_to = konto2 "aneks"

version transfer_back
  cite bank_export
  governs 2026-05
  known 2026-05-20
  covers konto2 2026-05-15..2026-05-15
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-05-15, kind: wages, leg cash from world to konto2 amount 5 000.00 PLN, fulfils: adjustments[wage[2026-03].cash, move_acct]) "line 1"

ask b: bal(konto2, 2026-05-31)
=== expect
b: 5 000.00 PLN
  adjustment: wage[2026-03] by 0.00 PLN on 2026-05-01 (version move_acct), remaining -5 000.00 PLN
  cut 2026-10-20
